# Ajani Unrelenting: "-3: Ajani deals 4 damage to each creature except for tokens you control." On turn 5 the battlefield holds
# Bot1's Ornithopter (a card, dies) and the Cadet from turn 3's +1 (a token, spared), and Bot2's Fanatic of Rhonas (1/4: 4 damage
# is exactly lethal), two Soldier tokens from Elspeth, Storm Slayer (tokens, but not Bot1's, so they die) and Elesh Norn, Mother
